<div style="text-align: center;">
    <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; background-color: #eff6ff; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 16px;">
        Payment Proof Received
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Hi {{name}},
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We have received your manual payment proof for <strong>{{currency}} {{amount}}</strong>. Our team will review it shortly.
    </p>

    <div style="background-color: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #ffedd5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #c2410c; margin: 0;">
            <strong>Status:</strong> Pending Review
        </p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">
        You will receive another email once your payment is confirmed.
    </p>
</div>